{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_4001_049mom", "source_sha256": "0dcfd570a83b78e0706a0b55008cc96a53d7eab18187cbac60a1c94ed9e82c6b", "ja": "ちょっと、お兄ちゃん！　どこ行ってたの！？", "zh": "喂，大哥哥！你刚刚跑去哪里了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_4002_049mom", "source_sha256": "6ca6cf131ad810f92f016d51ad6952a9fc17e29a6b7faadbc5d85659d6dd512c", "ja": "おかげで桃子、大御所さんの楽屋に、\nひとりで挨拶に行くことになったじゃない！", "zh": "拜你所赐，害桃子一个人到\n资深前辈的休息室打招呼去了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_4003_p", "source_sha256": "59894b6a3de482c109d158a27d9e2b66b2feb17b2c203cecd34d80a357c70c7f", "ja": "ごめん、ちょっと仕事の電話が入って……。\n桃子、ひとりで大丈夫だったか？", "zh": "抱歉，正好接到谈公事的电话……\n桃子你一个人没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_4004_049mom", "source_sha256": "fd8624bdeed751801494372231c23ebbdfe8139805b6207ff405d7dcbea3a571", "ja": "そんなの、大丈夫に決まってるじゃない。\n芸能界は、桃子のほうがずーっと長いんだから。", "zh": "还用说吗？当然是没问题。\n桃子待在演艺圈的时间可是比你长多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_4005_049mom", "source_sha256": "09721f87fd1e6e13461640e4255eb19ef417a575eedb5d559209dc259b2cca63", "ja": "でも、桃子のプロデューサーとしては……おわびに、\n何か桃子が喜ぶようなことをするべきなんじゃない？", "zh": "但是，作为桃子的制作人……应该要\n做点能让桃子开心的事来补偿才对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_4006_p", "source_sha256": "9fb9ec156022a9c321b42a5de81859d8f09a7f79f1f1b3a10b663e67bb9ff65d", "ja": "わかったよ。じゃあ……。", "zh": "我知道了，那……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_4007", "source_sha256": "9e0037914ab58d00c1995c54b8e982e142a344551e1d17c4cf3dcd9ccc67d282", "ja": "台本チェックに\n付き合う", "zh": "陪桃子确认剧本", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_4008", "source_sha256": "84fab4f75078a37f2bab84ff992c226ecbf5e7af480af59597883738af3d173b", "ja": "本を読み聞かせる", "zh": "念故事给桃子听", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_4009", "source_sha256": "78df9662c63973915db8c437d99a0ac4963e432de43f637cfea51826391a907d", "ja": "踏み台を磨く", "zh": "擦拭垫脚凳", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_4100_p", "source_sha256": "5ed320672a223ec5a54fd3f6fce27180e9ad75c3843dc5364e150dc1d13e8fc4", "ja": "台本読みに付き合うよ。桃子は本番前、\nいつも念入りにチェックしてるもんな。", "zh": "我就陪你读剧本吧，在正式录影前，\n桃子总是很仔细地确认剧本呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_4101_049mom", "source_sha256": "6e814139601a2c026b170badb2c28ca7bcc04d9fc33f07ac0da2230343651ca0", "ja": "ふぅん。少しはプロの仕事がわかってきたみたいだね、\nお兄ちゃん。", "zh": "哦，看来你也多少开始了解专业人士的工作了呢，\n大哥哥。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_4102_049mom", "source_sha256": "49118e525a343502c33823843d3e5672667ca3cab1ab568d611d9c0fbaef15e1", "ja": "それじゃ、本番が始まるまで、桃子と読み合わせだよ？\nお兄ちゃんは、大御所さんの役ね！", "zh": "那在正式录影前，就陪桃子对台词啰？\n大哥哥要演资深前辈的角色喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_4200_p", "source_sha256": "b23ad035d7c524eb2b8bc76fbb4bb6f107d3890267ac9b5da438a330f70219df", "ja": "お詫びに、絵本を読むっていうのはどうかな？\n読み聞かせとか……。", "zh": "作为补偿，一起来读绘本怎么样？\n我读给桃子听……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_4201_049mom", "source_sha256": "26026c4124a8be32500af8f1acd6b5b04a4702767cf940f0006d085ebfcec527", "ja": "……あのね、お兄ちゃん。桃子は、もう大人だよ？\n子どもじゃないんだから、本くらい自分で読めるよ。", "zh": "……大哥哥，搞清楚，桃子已经是大人了喔？\n都已经不是小孩了，桃子自己就可以读书。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_4202_049mom", "source_sha256": "1b9c55f97e42a5483052d4d8fabb2f6a47ff554b8d02f1e903d6e480262f8b5f", "ja": "まぁ……どうしてもお兄ちゃんが読みたいなら、\nちょっとくらい、つきあってあげてもいいけど……。", "zh": "不过……如果大哥哥无论如何都想读的话，\n要桃子陪你一下下也是可以啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_4203_049mom", "source_sha256": "6bf8ec42e2d818a19357b0edf2d8d16fd6a94a23d1fcbf84414926360bfd7945", "ja": "……で？　どれを読んでくれるの？\n早くしないと、本番が始まっちゃうよ！", "zh": "……所以呢？大哥哥要读哪一本？\n要是慢吞吞的，正式录影就要开始了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_4300_p", "source_sha256": "de4f4b66f3ddd8036e0419dd276203d3a3d76a98feead95d793f42068ad6f149", "ja": "お詫びに、桃子の大事にしてる踏み台を磨くよ。\nこれで許してくれるか？", "zh": "作为补偿，我来把桃子最宝贝的垫脚凳擦干净吧。\n这样可以原谅我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_4301_049mom", "source_sha256": "54acb4b3e712661dbed47787f85a36e23f586ad8fbb9bba3c63fb2cc18a6ede4", "ja": "ふーん……まあまあ、いい心がけだね。\nいいよ、今回はそれで許してあげる。", "zh": "哦……还算用心嘛。\n好吧，这次就原谅大哥哥。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_4302_049mom", "source_sha256": "b5644e79255958ca5983552d5af18704b01bd47e23207e9ab07e4d38a5cfb797", "ja": "でも、また同じ失敗したら、承知しないんだからね！", "zh": "但如果再犯一样的错，桃子可饶不了你喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
